msgstr "数传-XBee"

#: ../../source/docs/common-telemetry-xbee.rst:7
#: 43bf2beb0fde4514a880a82c3ef73cd5
msgid ""
"XBee radios (also known as ZigBee radios) are generally not recommended over"
" the :ref:`SiK Radio <common-sik-telemetry-radio>` and :ref:`RFD900 Radio "
"<common-rfd900>`.  Still there may be some situations where only an XBee can"
" be used so these high-level instructions could be helpful."
msgstr ""
"XBee 电台（也称为 ZigBee 电台）通常不推荐替代 :ref:`SiK Radio <common-sik-telemetry-radio>` "
"和 :ref:`RFD900 Radio <common-rfd900>`。但在某些情况下可能只能使用 XBee，以下高级说明可供参考。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-telemetry-xbee.rst:16
#: 74aa895ab3af41b0889bfef3e8854dd8
msgid "Where to Buy"
msgstr "购买渠道"

#: ../../source/docs/common-telemetry-xbee.rst:18
#: e0b2c2b1e8934faabb6fc934fc98cdd7
msgid ""
"XBee radios are available from `Sparkfun "
"<https://www.sparkfun.com/categories/111>`__ and many other robotics stores "
"globally.  Generally you will need two XBee radiios (one for the ground "
"station and one for the vehicle) along with two different adapter boards. "
"`One with a USB connection <https://www.sparkfun.com/products/11812>`__ for "
"the ground station computer and `another with a serial connection "
"<https://www.sparkfun.com/products/11373>`__ which can be connected to the "
"autopilot as shown above."
msgstr ""
"XBee 电台可从 `Sparkfun <https://www.sparkfun.com/categories/111>`__ "
"和全球众多机器人商店购买。通常您需要两个 XBee 电台（一个用于地面站，一个用于飞行器）以及两种不同的转接板：地面站电脑使用 `USB 接口转接板 "
"<https://www.sparkfun.com/products/11812>`__，飞控侧使用 `串口接口转接板 "
"<https://www.sparkfun.com/products/11373>`__（如上图所示连接到飞控）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-telemetry-xbee.rst:28
#: 28ef1974a4604477bbfa94901e69f824
msgid "Configuration"
msgstr "配置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-telemetry-xbee.rst:30
#: a57c7f299adc4f54b8e38326ad594403
msgid ""
"Click on the diagram at the top of this page to see the individual wire "
"connections that must be made between the autopilot and Xbee module. Note "
"that in the diagram above only 4 wires are connected (GND, 5V, Transmit, "
"Receiver). The CTS and RTS (Ready-to-send) pins are left unconnected because"
" although connecting them should improve the data rate during the creation "
"of this wiki page we were unable to successfully connect. With the CTS and "
"RTS pins disconnected the BRD_SER1_RTSCTS (if using Telem1) or "
"BRD_SER2_RTSCTS (if using Telem2) should be set to zero (after making the "
"change the autopilot will need to be restarted)."
msgstr ""
"点击本页顶部的示意图可查看飞控与 XBee 模块之间必须连接的各引脚。注意上方示意图中仅连接了 4 根线（GND、5V、发送、接收）。CTS 和 "
"RTS（就绪发送）引脚未连接，因为虽然连接它们应该可以提升数据速率，但在编写本 wiki 页面时我们未能成功连接。在 CTS 和 RTS "
"引脚未连接的情况下，BRD_SER1_RTSCTS（使用 Telem1 时）或 BRD_SER2_RTSCTS（使用 Telem2 时）应设为 "
"0（修改后需重启飞控）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-telemetry-xbee.rst:44
#: 38c57f635a9d4066a5834ab57858d43a
msgid ""
"The `X-CTU <https://www.digi.com/products/xbee-rf-solutions/xctu-"
"software/xctu>`__ application can be used to configure the XBee modules."
msgstr ""
"`X-CTU <https://www.digi.com/products/xbee-rf-solutions/xctu-"
"software/xctu>`__ 应用可用于配置 XBee 模块。"

